Why Is Demand Increasing
Expansion of Digital Commerce: Increasing online shopping activity is creating sustained demand for reliable payment infrastructure that supports multiple payment methods and transaction environments.
Mobile-First Consumer Behavior: Digital wallets, QR codes, biometric authentication, and mobile checkout solutions are becoming increasingly important as consumers seek faster and more convenient payment experiences.
Security and Fraud Management: Payment providers are investing in tokenization, AI-driven fraud detection, adaptive authentication, and stronger data-security measures to address increasingly sophisticated fraud risks.

